Kaeno redesign: clients on terminal, web and mobile connect to one authentica=
ted service. A trusted, versioned registry defines agents and capability ceil=
ings. A durable supervisor checks in on isolated specialists and steers by bo=
unded, auditable commands. Each assignment runs Pi Durable in its own sandbox=
, workspace and private store, with scoped secrets on trusted cloud or self-h=
osted hardware. The control plane owns placement, durable inboxes and exclusi=
ve leases; unsafe failover blocks instead of duplicating work. Architecture d=
rawing attached. Full visual presentation: docs/design/kaeno-next.html (in re=
pository).

